{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126191652764-1126_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261126191652\"/><p>格列霍夫涉受賄被捕。</p><p>俄羅斯莫斯科第235衞戍軍事法院周三（25日）決定採取強制措施，逮捕空天軍分管裝備事務的副總司令格列霍夫。</p><p>逮捕格列霍夫的申請由聯邦偵查委員會軍事偵查局提出，消息人士指格列霍夫已被捕，被控受賄罪名，涉案金額特別巨大，格列霍夫自2021年起擔任空天軍副總司令。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.655598+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T11:16:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:28.696895+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:28.837199+00:00","content_hash":"110ea4941221c54c238da1bbab1e353cc90b0784e0336d494fa2ca3543dd5285","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}